WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.000
1. Enter soft-pin placement

00:00:03.000 --> 00:00:06.000
2. Place two resting points

00:00:06.000 --> 00:00:09.000
3. Give the pins different priorities

00:00:09.000 --> 00:00:11.042
Motion replay: the weaker soft pin stretches farther.

00:00:11.042 --> 00:00:14.042
4. Pose the part and compare stretch

00:00:14.042 --> 00:00:17.042
5. Reset the resting points for another adjustment
